{
  "title": "Omnichannel Activities: Work, Complete and Log Calls and Texts | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "An activity is one piece of work for one contact: a call to make, a text to send, or an inbound call to log. See how an agent reads the activity list, completes an activity with a disposition that schedules the next step, creates an outbound activity, logs an inbound call, and edits or purges activities.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why activities\n• The activity list, its local times and filters\n• Completing an activity with a disposition and its workflow preview\n• Scheduling an outbound activity from a contact\n• Logging an inbound call\n• Editing and purging activities, and who dispositioned them\n• Reviewing AI conversations and handoffs",
